@ui_multi-page_navigation@authentication@fr_001Feature: User Registration & Authentication  As a Registered Customer  I want to reset my password via email  So that I can regain access to my accountBackground:  Given a registered user "resetuser@shopsphere.com" exists with password "OldPassword@123"  And I am on the login pageScenario: Successfully reset password and log in  When I click on "Forgot Password"  And I enter "resetuser@shopsphere.com" into the email field and submit  Then I should see a confirmation message "Password reset link sent to your email."  When I open the password reset link from the email  And I enter a new password "NewSecure@789" and confirm it  Then I should see a success message "Your password has been reset successfully."  And I should be redirected to the login page  When I log in with "resetuser@shopsphere.com" and "NewSecure@789"  Then I should be successfully logged in